uments:\ns151_b_applies(taxpayer:string,spouse:string,year:integer)\ns151_c_applies(taxpayer:string,dependent:string,year:integer)\ns63_f_1_A(taxpayer:string,year:integer)\ns63_f_1_B(taxpayer:string,spouse:string,year:integer)\ns151_b(taxpayer:string,exemption_amount:number,year:integer)\ns152_c_1(dependent:string,taxpayer:string,year:integer)\nKeep source polarity and taxpayer/beneficiary direction. A151(d) statement is not automatically a151(b)/(c) fact. Never assert the target predicate or infer unstated ages, deaths or relationships. This is shared infrastructure, not learned legal knowledge.","role":"system"},{"content":"{\"task\": {\"current_case\": {\"facts\": \"Alice is entitled to an exemption under section 151(d) for Bob for the year 2015.\", \"question\": \"Under section 151(d)(2), Bob's exemption amount for the year 2015 is equal to $2000.\\nNative query constraints from this same original TRAIN task (truth value not supplied): s151_d_2(\\\"Bob\\\",_,2000,2015).\"}, \"current_legal_query\": {\"native_query\": [{\"arguments\": [\"Bob\", {\"variable\": \"_\"}, 2000, 2015], \"predicate\": \"s151_d_2\"}], \"query_clause\": \"s151_d_2\"}, \"component_meanings\": {\"family_relationship_residence\": \"只由 facts 中独立明确的亲属、共同住所或实际出生陈述建立有向事件；婚姻、依赖关系、服务地点和问题文本不能替代这些陈述。\"}}, \"output_schema\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"family_relationship_residence\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"required\": [\"views\"], \"properties\": {\"views\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"minItems\": 1, \"items\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"required\": [\"extraction_status\", \"relationships\", \"residences\", \"births\", \"witnesses\"], \"properties\": {\"extraction_status\": {\"enum\": [\"complete\", \"unread\"]}, \"relationships\": {\"type\": [\"array\", \"null\"], \"items\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"required\": [\"relation_type\", \"source_basis\", \"source_term\", \"related_person\", \"ref